<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA- to Osaka Gas Eurobond due 2007.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA- to Osaka Gas Eurobond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Thursday that it had assigned its AA- rating to Osaka Gas Co Ltd's $400 million 7.125 percent Eurobond due on February 7, 2007.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said in a statement that the outlook for the rating was stable.</p>
<p>It said the rating reflected the company's important position in Japan's gas industry, supportive regulation, and the firm's stable operational and financial performance.</p>
</text>
